                          <Text> [I]    - Scan DNA sample.
 [II]   - Select sample to edit gnomes.
 [III]  - Insert sample into petri dish.

          Sample    1: cosca
          Sample   2: linaf
          Sample   3: raclga
          Sample   4: liean
          Sample   5: ilamo
          Sample   6: nipurt
          Sample   7: dajer
          Sample   8: shru
          Sample   9: crialol
          Sample  10: hsif</Text>
