                          <FontSize>1</FontSize>
                          <Text>For my replacement,
I have stabilized the clone samples.
It was easier than expected to create
new copies and start growing new 
people, but the problem I cant solve 
is accelerating their growth. I dont 
think we can wait 15 years for them
to mature enough to be useful.

Word is we found the location of 
another core, so maybe we will 
never need these clones.</Text>
