                        <Text>Log:
- Rotation one, One sighting, single scout 
overhead, Did not engage.
- Rotation two, No sightings.
- Rotation three, One sighting, 
Scavenger crafts, Did not engage.
- Rotation four, Two sightings, Scavenger 
crafts, Engaged with secondary battery, 
No damage to facility.
- Rotation five, No sightings, Resupply
 Arrived, Crew rotated.
- Rotation six, Hostile Battleship craft sighted,
Engaged with main battery, Three shots 
discharged, Three Direct Hits, Enemy Immobilized.
 Pride of Valkor arrived to clean up the rest.
- Rotation Seven, No sightings, Large wormhole
 detected, wreckage landed near facility. No
 hostiles detected.
- New Directive from Kabal: EVAC. 
All forces are to extract from this facility and
 return to Kabal. Bring all personal items,
 bring any sensitive information. </Text>
