                        <MySerializedTextPanelData>
                          <ChangeInterval>0</ChangeInterval>
                          <Font Type="MyObjectBuilder_FontDefinition" Subtype="Debug" />
                          <FontSize>1</FontSize>
                          <Text>I dont like this... what is Kabal trying to do 
with these DNA samples? Where did they 
even come from... their radiation levels 
dont match ours, they must have spent a
large part of their life under ground. I
understand that we need more man power
but is cloning random people the answer?

If we ever fix that gate and make it home...
will home even recognize us?</Text>
