                  <ComponentData>
                    <TypeId>MyLcdSurfaceComponent</TypeId>
                    <Component xsi:type="MyObjectBuilder_LcdSurfaceComponent">
                      <SelectedRotationIndex>0</SelectedRotationIndex>
                      <TextPanelContent>
                        <ChangeInterval>0</ChangeInterval>
                        <Font Type="MyObjectBuilder_FontDefinition" Subtype="Debug" />
                        <FontSize>0.758</FontSize>
                        <Text>Reminders:

We know the gate went offline, but we dont know why,
and we cant even fabricate the parts to even think about 
fixing it.

In theory a strong enough core could give us range to 
push a ship through FTL but we only have a single hull
that would survive the stress of such a long jump.

Wormholes are becoming more frequent and more stable.

Black Boxes recovered from wreckage emerging from the
wormholes show ships are pulled from several regions,
it might be possible to use a wormhole to escape this 
wasteland.

REMINDER: the guy across the hall is a freak.
</Text>
                        <ShowText>NONE</ShowText>
                        <FontColor>
